{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And now, please stay here, etc.</b> He spoke in the language of request, for he was concerned lest they do as the elders of Midian did on another occasion — those of blessed memory, who returned to their place and did not stay with him (Numbers Rabbah 20:8). And since the men were many and distinguished, he feared they might go on their way when they heard 'stay here,' and his going with them would not be settled."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:12:34.250026397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}